  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-10-24T03:15:57.795Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, you can only set a parameter to a specific value.\nI think that this script should also be able to set it to the current value +n, or -n.\nThis would allow very complex state machines with very few states, compared to now, where you would need to make potentially a million states to get the same effect.",
